    "narrative": "With the season winding down on 2026-09-29, the Zurich Zebras lean heavily into speed and situational matchups to maximize our 5x5 Roto efficiency. Our premier play today is **Pete Crow-Armstrong** (78.29), whose elite sprint speed makes him an absolute must-start against King, M. Despite the respectable 4.39 xERA of the opposing starter, **Pete Crow-Armstrong**\u2019s dynamic platoon advantage (+14%) and the lead-off spot boost him well into the \"Strong\" territory. Conversely, **Trea Turner** (54.64) draws a tougher assignment against Sale, but his floor remains secured by his lead-off position; while the SP skill penalty is significant (-19%), his ability to provide stolen bases keeps him in the lineup despite the challenging matchup.\n\n**Yordan Alvarez** (46.83) and **Chase Meidroth** (41.04) round out the starting unit, though both operate near the margins. **Yordan Alvarez** faces a difficult L/L matchup, which hampers his overall potential despite his elite 0.442 xwOBA, while **Chase Meidroth** is relegated to the #8 spot, dragging his score down to just above our 40.0 floor. We have opted to bench **Caleb Durbin** (39.75), who narrowly missed the cut; despite a favorable park factor, his presence at the #9 spot against a sub-3.00 xERA arm like Schlittler rendered him a liability for our game cap management. \n\nBeyond our active starters, the remainder of our depth\u2014including **Junior Caminero**, **Christian Yelich**, **Kazuma Okamoto**, **Colt Keith**, **Christian Encarnacion-Strand**, **Carson Benge**, **Gary Sanchez**, **Lars Nootbaar**, **Casey Schmitt**, **Dillon Dingler**, **Josh Smith**, **Jacob Gonzalez**, **Hector Rodriguez**, **Luis Pena**, and **Pedro Ramirez**\u2014are inactive due to team off-days or tactical rest. We are monitoring the weather closely, though no specific stadium warnings have emerged to further dampen the outlook for **Pete Crow-Armstrong** or **Trea Turner**. The focus remains on aggressive base-running and capitalizing on every plate appearance as we chase the league title.",
